    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Place a buy or sell order. Tokens are locked immediately.\\nThe engine then tries to auto-match against opposing orders.\\n\\nFor BUY:  lock pay_token (the quote currency, e.g. USDC)\\nFor SELL: lock token (the base currency, e.g. XLIGHTSTARCOIN)\\n\\nReturns the order ID.",
